This is John from Ohio.

00:00:10.259 --> 00:00:13.900
Hey, John, what's up?

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:19.050
So we only just started getting some recognition
of terror, Reed.

00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:20.050
Sorry.

00:00:20.050 --> 00:00:24.960
Look, in the mainstream media, but it still
isn't getting the attention that I think it

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:26.650
should get.

00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:31.280
Give a take on why that is or you have to
take her opinion on the issue in general.

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:32.360
Well, listen.

00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:38.449
I mean, my view has always been that people
who who come forward and say this happened

00:00:38.449 --> 00:00:43.370
to me should be heard and their claims should
be taken seriously and investigated.

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:49.160
And that's my view, regardless of who's being
accused of political or or political party.

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:50.219
Full stop.

00:00:50.219 --> 00:00:51.219
Right.

00:00:51.219 --> 00:00:52.670
I mean, that that's my view.

00:00:52.670 --> 00:00:58.210
And then, you know, there should be a full
and proper investigation in terms of why it's

00:00:58.210 --> 00:01:01.690
not getting more coverage in corporate media.

00:01:01.690 --> 00:01:05.010
I have two ideas about that.

00:01:05.010 --> 00:01:13.330
One is that there is skepticism among some
in corporate media about elements of the story.

00:01:13.330 --> 00:01:15.720
Now, I'm not an expert on the story.

00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:20.720
So it would sort of be beyond me to go through
all of those details now just on the basis

00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:21.720
