00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:24.880
You know, I'm not not prepared to do that
right now, nor nor do I think that it's necessarily

00:01:24.880 --> 00:01:26.590
the best thing to be doing.

00:01:26.590 --> 00:01:33.070
But I think part of what's holding down coverage
in corporate media is skepticism of some elements

00:01:33.070 --> 00:01:34.710
of the story.

00:01:34.710 --> 00:01:37.150
And whether that's right or wrong is a real
debate to be had.

00:01:37.150 --> 00:01:38.150
Right.

00:01:38.150 --> 00:01:42.440
I mean, if you believe that accusers allegations
should be taken seriously, then, you know,

00:01:42.440 --> 00:01:45.050
take them seriously and and investigate.

00:01:45.050 --> 00:01:49.110
And then I think the second thing is also
we're just in a crazy situation with coronavirus

00:01:49.110 --> 00:01:50.110
constantly.

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:54.000
And a lot of stories that would normally get
more attention, you know, stuff stuff related

